- content_for :page_title do
  Quick Search

- content_for :heading do
  %h1 Quick Search

%p.quick-search__intro
  Type a few words to find an admin action — you'll get the link, what it does, and anything to watch out for before you click.

.quick-search
  %input#quick-search-input.quick-search__input{ type: 'search', placeholder: 'Try "moderator", "delete a restaurant", "regenerate digest"…', autofocus: true, autocomplete: 'off' }

  #quick-search-results.quick-search__results

%script#quick-search-data{ type: 'application/json' }
  != @admin_actions.to_json.gsub('/', '\/')
